AddAntenna 20      328.12      650.25       51.28
AddAntenna 24     -160.98     -221.29       56.92
AddAntenna 25     -152.74     -800.33       58.39
AddAntenna 32     -165.50      356.01       56.25
AddAntenna 48     -670.30       70.54       66.38
AddAntenna 52     -173.80      933.07       59.86
AddAntenna 82     -668.57     1219.62       69.69
